            "description": {
              "content": "\nGet all chart data for the reports dashboard. Returns multiple chart datasets\nformatted for Recharts consumption.\n\nQuery Parameters:\n- date_range: Filter for all charts. Options: '7d', '14d', '30d', '90d', '365d', 'all' (default: '30d')\n\nReturns:\n- charts: Array of chart objects, each containing chartType, title, description, and chartData\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
